{
"file": 317,
"paths": [
"d008/d001/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "5c60f766",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "8a428e65",
"en_raw": "About what you said earlier"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "56139799",
"en_raw": "the rest of it..."
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "42f743dd",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "31e64ddf",
"en_raw": "Have you been here a while?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "13268ad7",
"en_raw": "Um, we're looking for"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "d0603dc0",
"en_raw": "the owner of this umbrella"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "595e58c2",
"en_raw": "That's a woman's umbrella"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "8f088ba1",
"en_raw": "Is it?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "d69649c5",
"en_raw": "...Come to think of it, it was the year before last"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0aeda9aa",
"en_raw": "I heard a story like this"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "b21d476f",
"en_raw": "from a taxi driver"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "eec6413b",
"en_raw": "He told me about it..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "7cd4c47e",
"en_raw": "What kind of story?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "136fb165",
"en_raw": "Well, at this bus stop"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "5ee68098",
"en_raw": "there was a traffic accident"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "a0221f04",
"en_raw": "In the middle of the night, a soaking wet woman"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "3b0b372c",
"en_raw": "That driver, creeped out"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "eb549431",
"en_raw": "refused to pick her up"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ba37549e",
"en_raw": "Refused?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a5e4029d",
"en_raw": "Yeah, he deliberately"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "3b57144f",
"en_raw": "didn't take the customer"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "d7bfa999",
"en_raw": "You know, haven't you heard"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "7fd60f47",
"en_raw": "those ghost stories?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "90c1e524",
"en_raw": "The 'take me to such-and-such cemetery' one"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "fd594602",
"en_raw": "I don't know it, but..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "209c5aa7",
"en_raw": "Oh, I see"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "58b8e21a",
"en_raw": "Well, it's fine"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "bc937381",
"en_raw": "Anyway, she was apparently"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "8f9f762c",
"en_raw": "a really strange woman"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "86fbbb53",
"en_raw": "But she wasn't a ghost"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "380bfa7b",
"en_raw": "That woman, refused by"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "eb5cec46",
"en_raw": "several taxis the same way"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "00d2bebf",
"en_raw": "must have lost patience"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "b62d07d6",
"en_raw": "She rushed into the rainy road"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "e0f1ca63",
"en_raw": "trying to stop cars in the opposite lane"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "59551745",
"en_raw": "...And then, bang bang bang"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "6a22cdd4",
"en_raw": "boom"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "8dc83472",
"en_raw": "...Did she die?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "c39720b4",
"en_raw": "Normally, people don't survive that"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "90e5be8d",
"en_raw": "The driver who was told"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "01cbeb86",
"en_raw": "about it afterward"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "7dfea1b9",
"en_raw": "apparently felt guilty"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "6833c9c8",
"en_raw": "and left flowers here"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f1e6c1b4",
"en_raw": "Since then, he said he'd always"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "65f757a9",
"en_raw": "pick up customers"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "0c8d1298",
"en_raw": "That's admirable, it saved me"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "710a7c8b",
"en_raw": "Well, I was"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "86c6ec64",
"en_raw": "soaking wet back then too"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "d83b189c",
"en_raw": "I see..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "fa6259af",
"en_raw": "I don't know anything beyond that"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "a3d78b2c",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "bb09de80",
"en_raw": "I wonder what the woman was"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "e50eeefc",
"en_raw": "rushing for in the rain"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "9fb71093",
"en_raw": "You're not interested"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "4b9e2cd9",
"en_raw": "in this kind of story?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "157ce6d4",
"en_raw": "Sorry about that"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "e333a75e",
"en_raw": "Thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "8080309b",
"en_raw": "Lean the umbrella / Don't  If you leave it there"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "e6292ad3",
"en_raw": "it'll get stolen"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "8b48a96d",
"en_raw": "We don't know whose it is"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "02ad7b4b",
"en_raw": "and leaving it here"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "bc4cea8a",
"en_raw": "seems a bit careless..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "877d7ffb",
"en_raw": "The one from before,"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "56139799",
"en_raw": "the rest of it..."
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "2ad325af",
"en_raw": "if the owner gets it back,"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "08f6c3d9",
"en_raw": "that'd be fine..."
}
]
}